  <div class="passphrase-band" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <main class="relative z-10 pt-24 pb-20 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <section class="passphrase-stage">
        <div class="passphrase-copy">
          <img src="/excited.png" alt="美穗看起来很兴奋" class="w-20 h-20 mb-5 mascot-glow" />
          <p class="passphrase-kicker">可读长期机密</p>
          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black mb-4 text-[#4A3728] dark:text-[#F0E6D8]">密码句</h1>
          <p class="text-[#8B7355] dark:text-[#B8A890] text-base leading-relaxed max-w-md">对于欢迎长度和可纪念性的地方来说, 长期、低调的秘密比满足粗糙的符号规则更重要。</p>
          <div class="passphrase-example" aria-hidden="true">开花老虎叶雾</div>
        </div>

        <div class="passphrase-tool" aria-labelledby="passphraseToolTitle">
          <div class="passphrase-tool-head">
            <div>
              <p class="passphrase-kicker">发电机</p>
              <h2 id="passphraseToolTitle" class="text-xl font-black text-[#4A3728] dark:text-[#F0E6D8]">新的密码句</h2>
            </div>
            <span class="passphrase-badge" id="passphraseCountBadge">4个字</span>
          </div>

          <button type="button" id="passphrasePanel" class="passphrase-panel">
            <output id="passphraseDisplay" class="passphrase-display" aria-live="polite">正在生成...</output>
            <span id="passphraseHint" class="passphrase-hint">点击密码句复制</span>
          </button>

          <div class="passphrase-actions">
            <button type="button" id="passphraseGenerate" class="cta-btn passphrase-generate">生成新密码句</button>
            <button type="button" id="passphraseCopy" class="passphrase-copy-btn">
              <span class="ui-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="9" y="9" width="11" height="11" rx="2"></rect><path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg>
              </span>
              复制
            </button>
          </div>

          <div class="passphrase-controls" aria-label="密码句选项">
            <div>
              <div class="control-label">单词</div>
              <div class="segmented-control" data-control="count">
                <button type="button" data-count="4" aria-pressed="true">4</button>
                <button type="button" data-count="5" aria-pressed="false">5</button>
                <button type="button" data-count="6" aria-pressed="false">6</button>
                <button type="button" data-count="8" aria-pressed="false">8</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <div class="control-label">分隔符</div>
              <div class="segmented-control" data-control="separator">
                <button type="button" data-separator="-" aria-pressed="true">-</button>
                <button type="button" data-separator=" " aria-pressed="false">空间</button>
                <button type="button" data-separator="." aria-pressed="false">.</button>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div>
              <div class="control-label">大小写</div>
              <div class="segmented-control" data-control="case">
                <button type="button" data-case="lower" aria-pressed="true">下调</button>
                <button type="button" data-case="title" aria-pressed="false">标题</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="passphrase-notes" aria-label="密码句指导">
        <div class="note-strip note-strip-green">
          <div class="note-icon ui-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2>允许长度时使用密码句 。</h2>
            <p>它们为保险库主密码,Wi-Fi密码,设备密码,恢复语句提供亮度,你需要手键,以及任何接受空格或分离器的地方.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="note-strip note-strip-yellow">
          <div class="note-icon ui-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3l7 3v5c0 5-3.2 8.4-7 10-3.8-1.6-7-5-7-10V6l7-3z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2>使用Firm或Extra Firm进行挑剔形式。</h2>
            <p>当一个站点需要首都、符号和数字时,主要发电机将这些要求保存在每一个Soft、Firm和Extra Firm密码中。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
